❗️ Last night, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation inflicted UAV strikes on logistics centres, depots and Ukrainian seaports, as well as vessels used in the interests of the AFU.

💥 As a result of the strikes, the following objects were engaged: 

📍 in Kiev region:

▫️ in the settlement of Schastlivoye, the BDU Logistic centre in which depots storing and distributing of military materiel were organised;

▫️ in the settlement of Boyarka, a gas distribution station providing gas supply to the defence industry facilities;

📍 in Odessa region:

▫️ in the port of Odessa, a dry cargo ship, delivering cargo intended to support the AFU;

▫️ in the port of Izmail, port infrastructure facilities used to unload and store military cargo.

▫️ In addition, a dry cargo ship delivering military cargo intended to support the AFU to the port of Odessa was hit at sea.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry
